"COUNTER PROGRAM"
Limit,|             "Read an integer."
[                   "Start the loop."
    ->+.            "Subtract 1 from the current cell, move to the right cell, add one to it and print."
    ?<              "Pause and then move to the left cell."
]                   "If the current cell isn't 0, go back to the start."

"Try running:" "python main.py tally.n --tape 3"